# Los modulos QML NO los detecta dpkg-shlibdeps y hay que escribirlos a mano.
#
# Su trabajo es leer el enlazado ELF, y un `import org.kde.kirigami` no es
# enlazado: es un directorio que Qt carga en tiempo de ejecucion. Sin estas
# lineas el paquete se instala perfectamente y la interfaz no arranca, que es
# el peor fallo posible de un empaquetado: parece correcto hasta que un usuario
# le da al icono.
#
# La lista sale de `qmlimportscanner` sobre src/ui/qml, la misma herramienta
# que usa Qt para decidir que desplegar, y de mapear cada modulo a su paquete
# con dpkg -S. Al anadir un import nuevo al QML hay que rehacerla:
#
#   /usr/lib/qt6/libexec/qmlimportscanner -rootPath src/ui/qml #     -importPath /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/qt6/qml
 qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami,
 qml6-module-qml,
 qml6-module-qt-labs-folderlistmodel,
 qml6-module-qt-labs-qmlmodels,
 qml6-module-qtqml,
 qml6-module-qtqml-models,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
 qml6-module-qtquick,
 qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
 qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
 qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window,
Recommends:
 gpu-screen-recorder,
 ffmpeg,
Description: Record your screen with GPU acceleration
 Recording your screen on Wayland is usually one of two things: a tool that
 re-encodes on the CPU and turns your laptop into a heater, or a command line
 with fifteen flags. Easy Screen Recorder is the missing layer: capture stays
 on the GPU and you start recording in two clicks.
 .
 It records any monitor, a region you drag, the focused window or a camera,
 with an audio-only mode to Opus or FLAC that does not turn on video capture
 at all. Pause and resume mid-recording, a global shortcut, multiple audio
 tracks, and it tells you what is missing before you press record.
 .
 Independent frontend for gpu-screen-recorder; not affiliated with it. It
 drives gpu-screen-recorder as a separate external process and does not
 include or distribute it, so that program has to be installed separately.
 Run "easy-screen-recorder-cli --check" to see what is present and what is
 missing.
